        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who are left in Zion, who remain in Jerusalem, will be called holy, all who are recorded among the living in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord will wash away the filth of the women of Zion; he will cleanse the bloodstains from Jerusalem by a spirit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of judgment and a spirit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of fire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.4.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will create over all of Mount Zion and over those who assemble there a cloud of smoke by day and a glow of flaming fire by night; over everything the glory",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "will be a canopy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It will be a shelter and shade from the heat of the day, and a refuge and hiding place from the storm and rain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
